## Roadmap

This project started as a college assignment. Once submitted, the scope was extended. Currently development status stays as such:

- [x] Port original Windows project to Linux
- [x] Add multiplatform support for CMake
- [x] Add unit testing
- [ ] Create editor
- [ ] Add music tracker
- [ ] Add final project serialization
- [ ] Add scripting
- [ ] Add development hot-reloading support
- [ ] Add end-user interaction support
- [ ] Add packaging and installation
- [ ] Add custom build pipelines
- [ ] Add cross-compilation pipelines
- [ ] Add autogenerated documentation


